**US-009 complete.** Implemented the Player Mode UI with:

- **`PlayerScreen.kt`** — new composable with 50/50 horizontal split: left panel (album art via Coil `AsyncImage`, title bold, album, artist) and right panel (seekable `Slider` with time labels, Previous/Play-Pause toggle/Next `IconButton`s, Lyrics toggle `TextButton`)
- **`MainActivity.kt`** — `MediaControlApp` now accepts `onCommand` callback and renders `PlayerScreen` for both `Playing` and `Paused` states; simplified non-player states to their own `Column` blocks
- **`build.gradle.kts`** — added `material-icons-extended` for media control vector icons
- **Typecheck** (`compileDebugKotlin`) — passes

